flowchart LR
  S[Context Sources] --> D[Discovery]
  D --> A[Acquisition]
  A --> N[Normalization]
  N --> X[Analysis]
  X --> G[Graph Enrichment]
  G --> P[Security Filtering]
  P --> C[Candidate Generation]
  C --> R[Explainable Ranking]
  R --> B[Budgeting]
  B --> O[Ordering]
  O --> E[Rendering]
  E --> Z[Versioned Bundle]

  T[Task + Profile] --> C
  POL[Context Policy] --> D
  POL --> P
  POL --> B
  I[(Index + Snapshots)] <--> N
  I <--> X
  I <--> G
  I --> C
  DIAG[Structured Diagnostics] -. emitted by every stage .-> Z
  PROV[Provenance + Confidence] -. preserved through every stage .-> Z
